"P3817773604" "Valentine"
// ProfessionString :
"P856364347" ""
// Script Variable CORRECT_DELIVERY_NAME :
"P3352535467" "Diabolique"
// Script Variable CORRECT_DELIVERY_TEXT :
"P2628792414" "<color orange>Diabolique begins to read the spell and then begin cackling fiendishly.</color><br><br>Oh, Percy Winkley! You simple little man. I have no heart in which to light a fire... But this certainly did bring back memories...<br><br>So pathetic to see that he has yet to realize that I used this very spell on him, all those years ago..."
// Script Variable WRONG_DELIVERY_NAME :
"P3948219263" "Vanessa DeVore"
// Script Variable WRONG_DELIVERY_TEXT :
"P796380362" "<color orange>Vanessa begins to read the spell and then shakes her head as if she were slightly light headed.</color><br><br>Oh Percy, Percy, Percy... That is a no-no!<br><br>One does not try to cast charm spells on girls during Valentine's Day, or any other for that matter.<br><br>I'll be certain to destroy this before it does any harm to anyone else."
// Script Variable VALENTINE_DISCOVERY_TEXT :
"P182943944" "You discover a striking vellum parchment, drenched in exotic musk and numerous arcane symbols. It reads:"
// Script Variable VALENTINE_TEXT :
"P2143511402" "<i>The strange magical words written on this parchment suddenly twist and form into a legible poem.<br><br><i>Powers dark<br>Powers light<br>Powers born of day and night<br>Grant me power keen and true<br>Grant me power over you<br>Obey my will<br>My one desire<br>In your heart I light this fire<br>Powers dark and powers light<br>Grant true love to Master Midnight!</i><br><br><color yellow>{hero.gender=male You're pretty sure this is a love spell, but it had no effect on you.|You started to feel a magical effect overtake you, but at the conclusion of the spell it all came crashing down.} Perhaps it requires the true name of the writer of the spell to work. You have a few ideas for who this should be delivered to that would be fairly amusing to see their reaction.</color>"
// Script Variable SENDER_NAME :
"P494595658" "Master Midnight"
// Script Variable VALENTINE_CLUE :
"P2781283005" "This heavy vellum parchment is in actuality a powerful love spell designed to charm the reader. Unfortunately for Master Midnight, he did not use his true name and so the spell won't work as intended."
// AskAboutTextOverride :
"P3668577043" "Reconsider your options"
// ContactRequiresText :
"P3611273721" "You are of the wrong alignment to get this tip."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2659787689" "You're unsure of exactly what to do with this information"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1255120992" "This Valentine is of no use to you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1338064068" "You already have enough things to do."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3623388284" "You're currently too busy to act upon this information."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3299591369" "Failsafe"

